From ca33bc7abcf231ffcbceefefb44fb088b7535198 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:12:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] perf(blocks): cache state-only outline shapes of
 decorative blocks

Forty decorative blocks created their outline shape (cuboids and unions)
on every call, and the default collision shape reuses the outline. Each
shape depends only on the block state, so move the unchanged computation
into createOutlineShape and serve it through ShapeCache.

Blocks whose outline is the full cube singleton are left unchanged since
they allocate nothing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TD7PJ5R7t7hM3ymeeqXP4H
